    "Attack Attribute": "None",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The leader of the Mineral Spring Yetis in the hot springs area, he styles himself the Icicle Emperor. Despite his arrogant posturing, he is at heart a coward. He once marched into Fire Dragon Valakas' nest to prove his strength, but became frightened and fled at the mere site of Valakas' sleeping form. He is now terrified of Valakas, and runs away or hides at even the sound of roaring. Giants Lv. 11 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Giants. P. Atk. +7% Max HP +7% Attack Range +15 Resistance to Shock +20% Resistance to Dagger +10% Resistance to Dual Dagger +10% Accuracy -5 Resistance to Spear -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Bare Hands Lv. 1 Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
